WEBVTT

00:00:02.673 --> 00:00:05.548
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Hello. Do you have a room for tonight?

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:11.705
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Let’s see. Yes, there’s a room on the second floor.

00:00:11.819 --> 00:00:13.812
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> Great. Can we see it?

00:00:14.019 --> 00:00:16.118
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Of course. Come with me.

00:00:18.774 --> 00:00:20.549
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Is there an elevator?

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:24.261
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> A lift? I’m sorry, no there isn’t.

00:00:24.688 --> 00:00:27.210
But I can help you with your cases.

00:00:33.779 --> 00:00:35.443
This is the room.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:41.919
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> Ah, it’s beautiful. I love it!

00:00:42.152 --> 00:00:45.471
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Yes, and there’s a great view of Loch Ness.

00:00:46.157 --> 00:00:47.503
Is there Wi-Fi?

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:51.693
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Yes, there is. The password is ‘Scotland’.

00:00:53.313 --> 00:00:56.383
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Is there a restaurant? We’re very hungry.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.938
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> No, there isn’t a restaurant.

00:00:59.185 --> 00:01:05.474
But you can have a sandwich in the bar, or there are some pubs in the village.

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.437
<v><b>Louisa:</b></v> Are there any shops near here?

00:01:08.637 --> 00:01:12.043
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> No, there aren’t any shops near the hotel.

00:01:12.339 --> 00:01:16.620
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> OK, thanks. I have one more question.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:17.378
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Yes?

00:01:17.637 --> 00:01:20.992
<v><b>Eric:</b></v> Is there really a monster in Loch Ness?

00:01:21.174 --> 00:01:27.085
<v><b>Receptionist:</b></v> Well, some people say there isn’t and some people say there is…

00:01:27.359 --> 00:01:31.729
Enjoy your stay. Breakfast is at eight.